/*
  Localizable.strings — English (source language)

  This is the CANONICAL reference file: it lists every localizable UI string in
  BetterCast. Keys are the English source strings. Other languages live in
  sibling <lang>.lproj folders and must contain the same set of keys.

  To contribute a new language, copy this file to localization/<code>.lproj/
  (e.g. es.lproj), translate the right-hand values, and open a pull request.
  Keep format placeholders (%@, %lld, %.1f) intact and in the same order.
*/

