/* Info tips */
"Extended creates a separate virtual monitor. Mirror duplicates your main display." = "Extended creates a separate virtual monitor. Mirror duplicates your main display.";
"Resolution of the virtual display. Higher resolutions use more bandwidth." = "Resolution of the virtual display. Higher resolutions use more bandwidth.";
"Doubles pixel density. Sharper text but uses more bandwidth." = "Doubles pixel density. Sharper text but uses more bandwidth.";
"Adjusts the brightness of your built-in display." = "Adjusts the brightness of your built-in display.";
"Streams system audio to the receiver. Requires a compatible receiver." = "Streams system audio to the receiver. Requires a compatible receiver.";
"Uses legacy display capture to bypass DRM/HDCP blocking (Netflix, Apple TV). May use more CPU and disables audio streaming. Only works when mirroring a physical display." = "Uses legacy display capture to bypass DRM/HDCP blocking (Netflix, Apple TV). May use more CPU and disables audio streaming. Only works when mirroring a physical display.";
"Automatically connect to discovered receivers when they appear on the network." = "Automatically connect to discovered receivers when they appear on the network.";
"Auto: AWDL for Apple devices, WiFi for others. P2P: forces direct link. Router: uses your WiFi network. Cable: USB/Thunderbolt only." = "Auto: AWDL for Apple devices, WiFi for others. P2P: forces direct link. Router: uses your WiFi network. Cable: USB/Thunderbolt only.";
"TCP is reliable and works everywhere. UDP has lower latency but only works over P2P/AWDL." = "TCP is reliable and works everywhere. UDP has lower latency but only works over P2P/AWDL.";
"Higher quality uses more bandwidth. Use Low/Medium on WiFi, High/Ultra on P2P or cable." = "Higher quality uses more bandwidth. Use Low/Medium on WiFi, High/Ultra on P2P or cable.";
